{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>The orcs are approaching and it's up to you and your army to defend the defenseless kingdom! Pick your soldiers from an array of distinct, upgradeable classes, devise a strategy, then stop them in their trails!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Route defense combined with RPG mechanics, focusing on the valiant defense of the kingdom against the onslaught of the orcs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your defenders from an array of distinct classes, each with its own strengths and weaknesses, from the mundane archer, through musketeers, to pikemen and gunners!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your army with hard-earned experience, unlocking special abilities that can turn the tide of the battle in your favor - but be careful, the enemy can do that as well...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with ever-more dangerous orcish attackers, each requiring a different approach. A berserker is fast and deadly, but the real danger might come from that slow, plodding shield-orc making his way in the background...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy a unique, hand-drawn animation style, inspired by classic 90s animated series!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969820/extras/237c6973ef6349caafcf5fddeb0400de.webp?t=1768951664\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969820/extras/237c6973ef6349caafcf5fddeb0400de.poster.avif?t=1768951664\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=352 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_ta